        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Megadeth\n- Albums: greatest hits albums, fourth studio album\n- Concepts: palindromes, album titles\n\nFacts:\n- Megadeth released a greatest hits album titled \"Greatest Hits: Back to the Start.\"\n- Megadeth's fourth studio album is titled \"Rust in Peace.\"\n- The title phrase \"Back to the Start\" references returning to an earlier Megadeth album in a palindromic framing.",
