        "original_id": "f5cdb12e-a1af-580e-b7c7-5b5ad84808fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Greatest Hits: Back to the Start, Rust in Peace\n- People: Megadeth\n- Companies: Capitol Records\n- Concepts: greatest hits albums, studio albums, lyric references\n\nFacts:\n- On September 24, 1990, Megadeth released Rust in Peace, its fourth studio album, through Capitol Records.\n- Rust in Peace includes the song “Rust in Peace...Polaris.”\n- The title of Greatest Hits: Back to the Start refers to lyrics in “Rust in Peace...Polaris” from Rust in Peace.\n- Greatest Hits: Back to the Start is Megadeth’s second greatest hits album.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
